  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"uf4a50ae7\" id=\"uf4a50ae7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4efd2e15\" id=\"u4efd2e15\">定时器就像你家的闹钟，设定好时间后，到点了就“叮叮”响，提醒你该做事情了。比如你设定5分钟后提醒自己休息一下，定时器一到5分钟就会告诉你“时间到了！”</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0530e0dc\" id=\"u0530e0dc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0f494cd\" id=\"ua0f494cd\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7a37fbba\" id=\"u7a37fbba\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub8549f9c\" id=\"ub8549f9c\">在机器里，定时器也是一样的。它能帮助机器按照设定的时间去做事情。比如让灯每隔1秒闪一下，或者告诉机器人什么时候该动，什么时候该停。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf3767ed3\" id=\"uf3767ed3\"><span data-lake-id=\"udcaa5bf6\" id=\"udcaa5bf6\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9db276bb\" id=\"u9db276bb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2bd7e222\" id=\"u2bd7e222\">在本节的学习中，我们可以利用定时器来切换灯的状态。例如每隔1秒钟，我们就切换一下灯的状态。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue8b19027\" id=\"ue8b19027\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35db9347\" id=\"u35db9347\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0d50933f\" id=\"u0d50933f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u78b7bbfb\" id=\"u78b7bbfb\">esp32总共有4个定时器，编号从0-3，我们任意使用其中一个就行</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22tim0%20%3D%20Timer(0)%20%23%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%B6%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KQzQ7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ude83eff0\" id=\"ude83eff0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaaf85b4f\" id=\"uaaf85b4f\">接下来对定时器进行初始化</span></p><ul list=\"u50b24166\"><li fid=\"u5e38e3df\" data-lake-id=\"u8d49adb9\" id=\"u8d49adb9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5cb25742\" id=\"u5cb25742\">period : 定时的毫秒值</span></li><li fid=\"u5e38e3df\" data-lake-id=\"u361fcafd\" id=\"u361fcafd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u84265b9e\" id=\"u84265b9e\">mode: 模式</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u50b24166\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u5e38e3df\" data-lake-id=\"ua96a8c94\" id=\"ua96a8c94\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77d42075\" id=\"u77d42075\">Timer.ONE_SHOT：定时器只会执行一次</span></li><li fid=\"u5e38e3df\" data-lake-id=\"u00876633\" id=\"u00876633\"><span data-lake-id=\"u63452bd8\" id=\"u63452bd8\">Timer.PERIODIC： 定时器每到时间满就会执行，会重复执行</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u50b24166\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u5e38e3df\" data-lake-id=\"u349c5954\" id=\"u349c5954\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8ef40d25\" id=\"u8ef40d25\">callback: 定时时间到的时候，执行的函数</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22tim0.init(period%3D5000%2C%20mode%3DTimer.ONE_SHOT%2C%20callback%3Dlambda%20t%3Aprint(0))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jLDUW%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u03f95254\" id=\"u03f95254\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u65d8843c\" id=\"u65d8843c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6fcb86a0\" id=\"u6fcb86a0\">参考代码</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20machine%20import%20Timer%5Cn%5Cntim0%20%3D%20Timer(0)%5Cntim0.init(period%3D5000%2C%20mode%3DTimer.ONE_SHOT%2C%20callback%3Dlambda%20t%3Aprint(0))%5Cn%5Cntim1%20%3D%20Timer(1)%5Cntim1.init(period%3D2000%2C%20mode%3DTimer.PERIODIC%2C%20callback%3Dlambda%20t%3Aprint(1))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EAfhS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u54b75781\" id=\"u54b75781\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3d460fc\" id=\"ub3d460fc\">示例代码：定时打印icheima.com</span></p><ol list=\"ube8349f8\"><li fid=\"u408d5741\" data-lake-id=\"u669b8d36\" id=\"u669b8d36\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud105f1e2\" id=\"ud105f1e2\">导包</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20machine%20import%20Timer%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mX0Pi%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"ube8349f8\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u408d5741\" data-lake-id=\"ub771aa0c\" id=\"ub771aa0c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue1c66041\" id=\"ue1c66041\">创建定时器</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%B6%E5%99%A80-3%5Cntime0%20%3D%20Timer(0)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zIvWs%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"ube8349f8\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u408d5741\" data-lake-id=\"u414ffd65\" id=\"u414ffd65\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31db14eb\" id=\"u31db14eb\">初始化定时器</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cndef%20mycallback(data)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22icheima.com%5C%22%2Cdata)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%B6%E5%99%A8%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%5Cntime0.init(mode%3DTimer.PERIODIC%2C%20period%3D1000%2C%20callback%3Dmycallback)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hMrVJ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>",
